### Sustain Monitor — full flow, step by step.
### Run each request in order (Visual Studio: "Send request"; VS Code: REST Client extension).
### Before starting: set the admin in user-secrets (see README) and run the API.
### Criterion ids below assume a fresh database (NREB seeded first). Check GET /api/tools/1 if unsure:
### EE1–EE9 = 1–9, EQ1–EQ15 = 10–24, SM1–SM7 = 25–31, MR1–MR6 = 32–37, WE1–WE5 = 38–42, IN1–IN2 = 43–44.

@api = https://localhost:7180
@adminEmail = admin@sustainmonitor.local
@adminPassword = ChangeMe123456
@ceoEmail = ceo@binaanhijau.my
@pmEmail = pm@binaanhijau.my
@supEmail = superior@binaanhijau.my
@pwd = Binaan2026Hijau

### 0. Health
GET {{api}}/health

### 1. Company registers (no login) — creates the CEO account
POST {{api}}/api/companies/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Binaan Hijau Sdn Bhd",
  "ssmNo": "202301012345",
  "cidbGrade": "G5",
  "address": "Jalan Ampang, Kuala Lumpur",
  "phone": "03-1234 5678",
  "ceoName": "Aminah Rahman",
  "ceoEmail": "{{ceoEmail}}",
  "password": "{{pwd}}"
}

### 2a. Platform admin logs in
# @name admin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### 2b. Admin lists pending companies
GET {{api}}/api/admin/companies?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 2c. Admin verifies company 1
POST {{api}}/api/admin/companies/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3a. CEO logs in
# @name ceo
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ceoEmail}}", "password": "{{pwd}}" }

### 3b. CEO: who am I
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3c. CEO invites the Project Manager (temporary password)
POST {{api}}/api/company/users
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Hafiz Ismail", "email": "{{pmEmail}}", "role": "ProjectManager", "temporaryPassword": "Temp2026Pass" }

### 3d. CEO invites the Superior
POST {{api}}/api/company/users
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Lim Wei Ming", "email": "{{supEmail}}", "role": "Superior", "temporaryPassword": "Temp2026Pass" }

### 4a. PM logs in with the temporary password
# @name pmTemp
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{pmEmail}}", "password": "Temp2026Pass" }

### 4b. PM must change password first (anything else returns 403 until then)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{pmTemp.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Temp2026Pass", "newPassword": "{{pwd}}" }

### 4c. PM logs in again
# @name pm
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{pmEmail}}", "password": "{{pwd}}" }

### 5a. Superior: temporary login, change password, log in again
# @name supTemp
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{supEmail}}", "password": "Temp2026Pass" }

###
POST {{api}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{supTemp.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Temp2026Pass", "newPassword": "{{pwd}}" }

###
# @name sup
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{supEmail}}", "password": "{{pwd}}" }

### 6a. PM: GBI tools
GET {{api}}/api/tools
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 6b. PM creates project on NREB (tool 1)
POST {{api}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "KLT", "name": "Kelulut HQ", "toolId": 1, "location": "Kuala Lumpur", "buildingType": "Office", "gfaM2": 1200, "targetRating": "Certified" }

### 6c. PM submits the baseline (47 of 55 targeted points; WE1 not yet done)
POST {{api}}/api/projects/1/baseline
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "SelfCheck",
  "scores": [
    { "criterionId": 1,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 2,  "pointsAwarded": 2 },
    { "criterionId": 2,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 3,  "pointsAwarded": 3 },
    { "criterionId": 3,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 2,  "pointsAwarded": 2 },
    { "criterionId": 4,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 5,  "pointsAwarded": 5 },
    { "criterionId": 5,  "status": "InProgress", "pointsTargeted": 15, "pointsAwarded": 10 },
    { "criterionId": 6,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 4,  "pointsAwarded": 4 },
    { "criterionId": 9,  "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 3,  "pointsAwarded": 3 },
    { "criterionId": 10, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 1,  "pointsAwarded": 1 },
    { "criterionId": 13, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 2,  "pointsAwarded": 2 },
    { "criterionId": 17, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 2,  "pointsAwarded": 2 },
    { "criterionId": 21, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 2,  "pointsAwarded": 2 },
    { "criterionId": 30, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 4,  "pointsAwarded": 4 },
    { "criterionId": 36, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 3,  "pointsAwarded": 3 },
    { "criterionId": 38, "status": "NotStarted", "pointsTargeted": 3,  "pointsAwarded": 0 },
    { "criterionId": 41, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 3,  "pointsAwarded": 3 },
    { "criterionId": 44, "status": "Achieved",   "pointsTargeted": 1,  "pointsAwarded": 1 }
  ]
}

### 7a. PM creates CO-ticket for WE1 Rainwater Harvesting (3 points)
POST {{api}}/api/projects/1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "criterionId": 38, "title": "Install rainwater harvesting tank", "description": "5 m³ tank for landscape irrigation", "pointsAtStake": 3, "priority": "High" }

### 7b. PM starts work
POST {{api}}/api/tickets/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "InProgress" }

### 7c. PM uploads evidence (put any PDF next to this file as evidence.pdf)
POST {{api}}/api/tickets/1/evidence?stage=CompletionVerification
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SMBOUNDARY

--SMBOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="evidence.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./evidence.pdf
--SMBOUNDARY--

### 7d. PM sends for review
POST {{api}}/api/tickets/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "InReview" }

### 8a. Superior sees the board (only Approve/Reject buttons for In review)
GET {{api}}/api/projects/1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{sup.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 8b. Superior approves with 3 points → re-score 47 → 50 (Certified)
POST {{api}}/api/tickets/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{sup.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "Done", "pointsGained": 3 }

### 9. Project: confirmed vs projected score, progress
GET {{api}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{pm.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 10. CEO runs the GBI analysis (progress 50/55 = 91% ≥ 80%) → e-cert requested
POST {{api}}/api/projects/1/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 11a. Admin: e-cert requests
GET {{api}}/api/admin/ecerts?status=Requested
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 11b. Admin approves e-cert 1
# @name issued
POST {{api}}/api/admin/ecerts/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 12. Public verification (what the QR code opens) — no login
GET {{api}}{{issued.response.body.$.verifyUrl}}

### Notifications for the CEO
GET {{api}}/api/notifications?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Score history
GET {{api}}/api/projects/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{ceo.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Forgot password (code is emailed, or logged when SMTP is not set)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/forgotPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{pmEmail}}" }
